description=Neat Building buildables pack compatible with Stairs East & South. Adds Neat Building buildable recipes/entities except the metal railing entities that conflict with Stairs East & South. Does not include the Neat Building UI; optionally enable Neat Building - UI Only if you want the Neat Building interface. Intended for new saves/servers, especially those using Stairs East & South and that have never loaded the full id=Neat_Building variant. Do not switch existing MP saves from id=Neat_Building to this pack without a backup and testing. Reviewed for Project Zomboid Build 42.20.
